  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "フワフワの　たいもうは　しょくぶつに　ちかいせいぶん。　こまめに　かおを　あらってかんそうを　ふせぐ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "복슬복슬한 털은 식물에 가까운 성분으로 이루어져 있다. 수시로 세수를 하면서 건조해지는 것을 방지한다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "毛茸茸的體毛有著近似於植物的成分。會勤快地洗臉以防止乾燥。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ce Pokémon lave assidûment son visage pour éviter qu’il ne s’assèche. La composition de son pelage soyeux est proche de celle des plantes.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Die Zusammensetzung seines weichen Fells ähnelt der von Pflanzen. Es reinigt penibel sein Gesicht, um zu verhindern, dass dieses austrocknet.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Su sedoso pelaje se asemeja en composición a las plantas. Se lava la cara con diligencia para que no se le seque.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il suo pelo vellutato ha una composizione simile a quella delle piante. Si lava il muso di frequente per evitare che si disidrati.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Its fluffy fur is similar in composition to plants. This Pokémon frequently washes its face to keep it from drying out.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "フワフワの　体毛は　植物に　近い成分。　こまめに　顔を　洗って乾燥を　防ぐ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "毛茸茸的体毛有着近似于植物的成分。会勤于洗脸以防止干燥。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Su sedoso pelaje se asemeja en composición a las plantas. Se lava la cara con diligencia para que no se le seque.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "からだから　はっする　あまいかおりで　まわりをみりょうする。　にっこうに　あたるとかおりは　さらにつよまる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "몸에서 나오는 달콤한 향기로 주위를 매료시킨다. 햇빛에 닿으면 향기가 더욱 강해진다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "會用身體發出甜甜香氣，讓周圍的一切為之傾倒。照到陽光後香氣會變得更濃郁。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il dégage une odeur sucrée qui fascine les êtres alentour. Celle-ci est plus forte lorsqu’il est exposé au soleil.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es verzaubert alle in seiner Umgebung mit dem süßen Duft, der von ihm ausgeht. Dieser wird durch Sonnenschein noch intensiver.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Su cuerpo desprende una dulce fragancia que embriaga a quien tiene a su alrededor. Esta se intensifica al exponerse a los rayos del sol.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il dolce profumo che emana dal corpo incanta chiunque si trovi nelle vicinanze e si intensifica quando il Pokémon si espone al sole.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "The sweet scent its body gives off mesmerizes those around it. The scent grows stronger when this Pokémon is in the sun.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "体から　発する　甘い香りで　まわりを魅了する。　日光に　当たると香りは　さらに強まる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "通过身体发出的甜甜香气来让周围的一切为之倾倒。晒到阳光后香气会更加浓郁。",
      "language": {
